  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FSDT&apos;s purpose is the improved capacity of Kenya&apos;s financial sector to meet the needs of poor Kenyans and micro, small and medium enterprise. FSD is a multidonor support programme (WB, DFID, AFD, Sida) and anchored on a Trust with an estimated investment of 20m&#xa3; for 5 years out of which, Sida will contribute 47MSEK.</narrative>
